<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Undangan Pernikahan Mahfud & Jamilah</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f1ed 0%, #fcfbfa 100%);
            color: #2c221e;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 50px 20px;
            background: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #8c7b6c;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .names {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            margin: 20px 0;
            color: #2c221e;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .date {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: #8c7b6c;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .divider {
            width: 60px;
            height: 2px;
            background: #d4c5b9;
            margin: 25px auto;
        }

        .quote-box {
            background-color: #fcfbfa;
            border-left: 4px solid #7f6954;
            padding: 30px;
            margin: 40px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .quote-box p {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #5a4d44;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .quote-box span {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #8c7b6c;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .music-player {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f7f5f2 0%, #ede8e3 100%);
            padding: 15px 25px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border: 1px solid #e6e2de;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .music-player button {
            background: #7f6954;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }

        .music-player button:hover {
            background: #6a5642;
        }

        .music-player span {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #5a4d44;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .greeting {
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        .greeting h2 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #2c221e;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .greeting p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #5a4d44;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .couple-section {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin: 45px 0;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .couple-card {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 240px;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .couple-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #2c221e;
        }

        .couple-card p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #665c54;
        }

        .couple-card strong {
            color: #2c221e;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .event-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fcfbfa 0%, #f7f5f2 100%);
            border: 1px solid #e6e2de;
            border-left: 4px solid #7f6954;
            padding: 30px;
            margin: 40px 0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
        }

        .event-box h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: #2c221e;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .event-detail {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #5a4d44;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .event-detail strong {
            color: #2c221e;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .gift-section {
            margin: 40px 0;
            padding: 25px;
            background: #fcfbfa;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid #e6e2de;
        }

        .gift-section h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: #2c221e;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .gift-section p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #5a4d44;
            line-height: 1.7;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e6e2de;
        }

        .footer p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #7f6954;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .footer-names {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #2c221e;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .thank-you {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #8c7b6c;
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                padding: 30px 15px;
            }

            .names {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }

            .couple-section {
                gap: 15px;
            }

            .couple-card {
                min-width: 100%;
            }

            .event-box {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .quote-box {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .footer-names {
                font-size: 1.6rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="subtitle">Dengan Hormat Kami Mengundang Anda</div>
        <h1 class="names">Mahfud (Apud) & Jamilah</h1>
        <div class="date">Sabtu, 22 Agustus 2026</div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <!-- Musik Latar -->
        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <div class="music-player">
                <button id="playBtn" onclick="toggleMusic()">🎵 Putar Musik</button>
                <span>Instrumen Romantis Pernikahan</span>
            </div>
            <audio id="bgMusic" loop>
                <source src="https://www.bensound.com/bensound-music/bensound-tenderness.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
                Browser Anda tidak mendukung elemen audio.
            </audio>
        </div>

        <!-- Ayat Suci -->
        <div class="quote-box">
            <p>"Dan di antara tanda-tanda kebesaran-Nya ialah Dia menciptakan pasangan-pasangan untukmu dari jenismu sendiri, agar kamu cenderung dan merasa tenteram kepada-Nya, dan Dia menjadikan di antaramu rasa kasih dan sayang."</p>
            <span>— Q.S. AR-RUM: 21 —</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Greeting -->
        <div class="greeting">
            <h2>Kepada Yth. Bapak/Ibu/Saudara/i</h2>
            <p>Tanpa mengurangi rasa hormat, kami mengundang Anda untuk hadir dan memberikan doa restu pada hari bahagia pernikahan kami.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Mempelai -->
        <div class="couple-section">
            <div class="couple-card">
                <h3>Mahfud (Apud)</h3>
                <p>Putra tercinta dari<br><strong>Bapak Suparman & Ibu Siti Fatimah</strong></p>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; color: #d4c5b9; font-size: 1.5rem;">
                &
            </div>
            <div class="couple-card">
                <h3>Jamilah</h3>
                <p>Putri tercinta dari<br><strong>Bapak H. Hilal & Ibu Nani</strong></p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <!-- Acara Pernikahan -->
        <div class="event-box">
            <h3>Acara Pernikahan</h3>
            <div class="event-detail">
                <strong>📅 Hari/Tanggal:</strong> Sabtu, 22 Agustus 2026
            </div>
            <div class="event-detail">
                <strong>🕘 Waktu Akad Nikah:</strong> Pukul 09:00 Pagi
            </div>
            <div class="event-detail">
                <strong>📍 Lokasi:</strong> Kp. Nutug, Desa Kalapanunggal, Kab. Sukabumi
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Hadiah -->
        <div class="gift-section">
            <h3>Tanda Kasih</h3>
            <p>Doa restu dan kehadiran Anda merupakan karunia terindah bagi kami. Semoga pernikahan kami menjadi ikatan yang penuh berkah dan kebaikan.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Penutup -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Merupakan suatu kehormatan dan kebahagiaan bagi kami apabila Bapak/Ibu/Saudara/i berkenan hadir untuk memberikan doa dan restu.</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Kami yang berbahagia,</p>
            <div class="footer-names">Mahfud & Jamilah</div>
            <p class="thank-you">Terima kasih atas dukungan dan doa Anda</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        var music = document.getElementById("bgMusic");
        var playBtn = document.getElementById("playBtn");
        var isPlaying = false;

        function toggleMusic() {
            if (isPlaying) {
                music.pause();
                playBtn.innerHTML = "🎵 Putar Musik";
                isPlaying = false;
            } else {
                music.play();
                playBtn.innerHTML = "⏸ Jeda Musik";
                isPlaying = true;
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
